   },
   {
    "text": "The courses must have been approved by the Medical Council of India",
    "page": 4
   },
   {
    "text": "Must have served as House Surgeon (CRRI) for a period of not less than twelve months",
    "page": 4
   },
   {
    "text": "Candidates should have registered their names in the Tamil Nadu Medical Council on or before the date of this notification",
    "page": 5
   },
   {
    "text": "If a candidate claims that the educational qualification possessed by him/her is equivalent though not the same as those prescribed for the appointment, the onus of proof rests with the candidate",
    "page": 5
   },
   {
